---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Exam Disclaimer - TypingWire"
  description="Important examination and educational disclaimer regarding government typing rules, SSC, High Court, and Steno test evaluations."
>
  <div class="prose-container disclaimer-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <span class="current">Disclaimer</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="header-tags">
      <span class="post-card-badge badge-coral">DISCLAIMER</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="display-lg">Examination Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: August 16, 2026</p>

    <hr class="section-divider" />

    <div class="article-content">
      <div class="alert-box">
        <strong>⚠️ Non-Government Affiliation:</strong>
        <p>TypingWire (<code>typingwire.in</code> and <code>blog.typingwire.in</code>) is an independent educational and speed training platform. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or in any way officially connected to the Staff Selection Commission (SSC), High Courts, District Courts, NTA, or any government recruitment body.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>1. Accuracy of Exam Guidelines</h2>
      <p>
        The error calculation formulas (Full Mistake vs Half Mistake, Backspace permissions, permissible error percentage) published on this portal are compiled based on previous years' official notifications, examination brochures, and public candidate guidelines.
      </p>
      <p>
        Recruitment boards reserve the right to modify evaluation rules for any exam session. Candidates are advised to always cross-verify guidelines with the official notification released by the respective recruiting authority.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Hardware & Keyboard Reviews</h2>
      <p>
        Reviews and recommendations of mechanical keyboards, switches, and typing accessories reflect our independent testing and typist consensus. We do not accept paid bias for positive hardware scores.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Consent</h2>
      <p>
        By using our website, you hereby consent to our disclaimer and agree to its terms.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .disclaimer-page {
    padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem 5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--colors-muted-text);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--colors-primary);
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--colors-muted-text);
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .section-divider {
    border: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--colors-hairline);
    margin: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .alert-box {
    padding: 1.5rem 1.75rem;
    background-color: var(--colors-block-coral);
    border: 1px solid #fecdd3;
    border-radius: var(--rounded-md);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .alert-box strong {
    color: #9f1239;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .alert-box p {
    color: #881337;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
